{%- comment -%}
  Bush Riding shelf — products in a gapped grid on bone, each picture sitting
  over a mist rule with the name and price on it.

  Deliberately not the chip-labelled card used elsewhere: chips floating over
  every image is a lot of chrome to repeat down a long page, and chrome is
  what makes a grid feel like an interface rather than a shop. The words sit
  below the picture in the page's own ink.

  Bone, not paper. The design system scopes white to chips and cards; a grid
  this size is a field, and a white field would punch a hole in the page.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  comment
    No collection assigned falls back to the whole catalogue, not to
    placeholders. A shelf that has to be configured before it shows anything
    real is a shelf that ships fake products to the live home page — which is
    what the old launch grid did, four invented items and all.
  endcomment
  assign coll = section.settings.collection
  if coll == blank or coll.products_count == 0
    assign coll = collections['all']
  endif

  assign limit = section.settings.products_to_show | default: 8
  assign cols = section.settings.columns | default: 4

  assign has_products = false
  if coll != blank and coll.products_count > 0
    assign has_products = true
  endif
-%}

{%- if has_products or request.design_mode -%}
<section class="alp alp-shelf alp-shelf--{{ cols }}up alp-shelf--{{ section.settings.image_ratio | default: 'square' }}" {% if section.settings.heading != blank %}aria-label="{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}"{% endif %}>
  {%- if section.settings.heading != blank or section.settings.link_label != blank or section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      The head runs on the same caption gutter as every passage on the site, so
      the eyebrow lines up with the ones above and below it.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <header class="alp-shelf__head">
      {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
        <p class="alp-shelf__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | escape | replace: '&lt;br&gt;', '<br>' }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      <div class="alp-shelf__headfield">
        {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
          <h2 class="alp-shelf__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.link_label != blank -%}
          <a class="alp-chip alp-shelf__more" href="{{ section.settings.link_url | default: routes.all_products_collection_url }}">{{ section.settings.link_label | escape }}</a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </header>
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="alp-shelf__grid">
    {%- if has_products -%}
      {%- for product in coll.products limit: limit -%}
        <a class="alp-shelf__cell" href="{{ product.url }}">
          <div class="alp-shelf__pic">
            {%- if product.featured_image != blank -%}
              {{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: product.featured_image.alt | default: product.title }}
            {%- else -%}
              <img src="{{ 'alpine-ph-card-1.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="750" height="1000" loading="lazy">
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if product.available == false -%}
              <span class="alp-shelf__flag">Sold out</span>
            {%- elsif product.compare_at_price > product.price -%}
              <span class="alp-shelf__flag">On sale</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
          <div class="alp-shelf__meta">
            <p class="alp-shelf__name">{{ product.title | escape }}</p>
            <p class="alp-shelf__price">
              {%- if product.compare_at_price > product.price -%}
                <s>{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</s>
              {%- endif -%}
              {{ product.price | money }}
            </p>
          </div>
        </a>
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        The store genuinely has no products yet — not "no collection picked",
        which the fallback above already handles. Say so in the editor rather
        than inventing a catalogue, and render nothing on the storefront: an
        empty shelf is honest, four made-up products are not.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <p class="alp-shelf__empty">This shelf is empty because the store has no products yet. Add products and they appear here automatically. Nothing is shown to customers meanwhile.</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Bush Riding shelf",
  "tag": "div",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Products edge to edge, hairline-ruled, name and price underneath. Assign a collection or it falls back to placeholder stills."
    },
    { "type": "collection", "id": "collection", "label": "Collection" },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "products_to_show",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 12,
      "step": 1,
      "label": "Products to show",
      "default": 8
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "columns",
      "label": "Columns on desktop",
      "options": [
        { "value": "2", "label": "2" },
        { "value": "3", "label": "3" },
        { "value": "4", "label": "4" }
      ],
      "default": "4",
      "info": "Always two across on a phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "image_ratio",
      "label": "Product image shape",
      "options": [
        { "value": "square", "label": "Square \u2014 safest for packshots" },
        { "value": "portrait", "label": "Portrait 3:4" },
        { "value": "adapt", "label": "Adapt \u2014 each photograph's own shape" }
      ],
      "default": "square",
      "info": "Images are never cropped, so a shape the photographs do not share shows as bands above and below them. Adapt removes the bands entirely at the cost of uneven rows."
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Header" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "info": "Sits in the left gutter, on the same line as every other eyebrow on the page. Use <br> for a second line." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "info": "Optional. Leave blank for a bare grid." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "link_label", "label": "Link label", "info": "e.g. \"All products\"." },
    { "type": "url", "id": "link_url", "label": "Link URL", "info": "Defaults to the all-products catalogue." }
  ],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "Bush Riding shelf" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
